&lt;p&gt;📍London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£110,000-£150,000 + equity + Incentive Awards tied to your performance + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core Banking&#39;s mission is to make everyday money magical for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re responsible for the products millions of customers rely on every day — from current accounts, joint accounts and accounts for kids and teens, through to money management, budgeting, and our paid subscriptions. These are some of Monzo&#39;s most loved experiences, and they&#39;re at the heart of how customers interact with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to grow, we&#39;re looking for a Senior User Research Manager to help shape the future of Personal Banking. This is an opportunity to lead research across one of Monzo&#39;s largest product areas, influence company strategy, and develop exceptional research leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be responsible for both people leadership and strategic research leadership. This includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading research across Core Banking while helping shape a coherent Personal Banking research strategy that spans multiple product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with the Core Banking Leadership Team, Product Directors, Design leaders and senior stakeholders across Wealth, Payments, Borrowing and our European business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping define and land parts of Monzo&#39;s global research operating model as we expand internationally, ensuring teams work effectively across both global and local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting customer insights across collectives, identifying themes, opportunities and gaps rather than viewing research through the lens of a single team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing together existing research, product data, market insights and quantitative evidence to help leadership make informed strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing managers and supporting approximately 6-8 direct and indirect reports while maintaining a consistently high bar for research quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating an environment where researchers can balance methodological rigour with the speed needed to build great products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading senior researchers and/or research managers within a complex product organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shaping and influencing product strategy through research at both organisational and executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across multiple product areas, bringing together disparate customer insights into a coherent strategic narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigating complex stakeholder environments where different teams have competing priorities, metrics and timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Product, Design, Engineering and Data Science leaders to influence roadmaps and business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining qualitative research with quantitative signals, product data and market insights to develop strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building alignment across large organisations and landing new ways of working with multidisciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching research leaders while maintaining a high quality bar across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making thoughtful trade-offs between research depth, pace and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌 What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £110,000 - £150,000 ➕ Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 £1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡 We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter call (30 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; A conversation with one of our recruiters to learn more about your background, motivations, and what you&#39;re looking for next, while giving you the opportunity to learn more about Monzo and the role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Ways of Working (45 minutes):&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll explore your leadership experience, approach to research strategy, and how you raise the research quality bar.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final loop (Total 1hr 30 - 2 hours):&lt;/strong&gt; Two interviews covering &lt;strong&gt;Managing Teams &amp;amp; People&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;, where we&#39;ll discuss your approach to developing research leaders, building high-performing teams, influencing strategy, and driving organisational impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 3-4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LG1&amp;nbsp; #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an ASO &amp;amp; Partnerships leader to drive organic growth and deepen platform relationships for Merge Dragons, Monster Legends, Dragon City, FarmVille titles and many more. This role owns the studio&#39;s app store optimization strategy end-to-end and serves as our primary relationship holder with the major app store platforms — Google Play, the Apple App Store, Microsoft Store and Amazon Appstore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead a team responsible for improving organic visibility, store conversion, and featuring, while working closely with Product, Creative, UA, and Data teams to unlock sustainable organic growth and strengthen the top of the funnel. You will mentor and empower the ASO team to deliver best-in-class execution, and you&#39;ll be the studio&#39;s trusted voice in front of our platform partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end ASO strategy for the portfolio, driving organic installs, store conversion, and keyword/category rankings across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and manage the yearly organic growth roadmap, including localization, seasonal, and launch strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the studio&#39;s platform partnership strategy, aligning featuring and promotional opportunities with business priorities and release calendars.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Platform Partnerships&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic relationships with Google Play, Apple App Store, Microsoft Store, and Amazon Appstore partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure featuring, editorial placements, and promotional opportunities across launches, updates, and key seasonal moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for early access to platform betas, new store features, monetization tools, and APIs, and channel those opportunities back to Product and UA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the studio in partner reviews, QBRs, and industry events, and negotiate co-marketing and joint business plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Performance Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead store listing experimentation (Custom Product Pages, Product Page Optimization, Google Play store listing experiments) to improve conversion rate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own keyword and metadata optimization, and build rigorous test roadmaps across icons, screenshots, preview videos, and descriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish measurement frameworks to attribute organic uplift and quantify the impact of ASO and featuring initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor ASO managers, specialists, and analysts; build structured career growth and execution excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Creative teams to fuel store asset testing velocity and creative breakthroughs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with UA, Product, and Data teams to ensure cohesive full-funnel optimization and visibility improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear accountability for results with transparent reporting and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve execution speed through better process, prioritization, and cross-team alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–10+ years of ASO or mobile organic growth experience in free-to-play, ideally in gaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of improving organic installs and store conversion at scale across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established working relationships with platform partner teams (Apple, Google, and ideally Microsoft and/or Amazon).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fluency in ASO tools (e.g. AppTweak, Sensor Tower, data.ai) and store listing A/B testing methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of app store algorithms, ranking factors, and each platform&#39;s merchandising ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: familiarity with Match-3/puzzle models and hybrid-casual or builder games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
