&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DataDome&lt;/strong&gt; delivers &lt;strong&gt;real-time bot and agent trust management&lt;/strong&gt;, enabling businesses to trust the intent behind their traffic—human, bot, or AI agent. Named a Leader in The Forrester Wave™ for Bot And Agent Trust Management Q2 2026, DataDome is trusted by enterprises like Etsy, PayPal, and Soundcloud. Acting as a traffic control plane, DataDome&#39;s multi-layered AI engine leverages thousands of models and 5 trillion signals daily, analyzing the intent of every session so only trusted traffic reaches your business — powering growth across your sites, apps, APIs, and MCP servers. Backed by a 24/7 SOC and expert threat researchers, DataDome stops 20k+ attacks every second. With 35+ global PoPs, and 80+ ready-made integrations, DataDome is a recognized Leader on G2 across several categories—delivering traffic you can trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to define and execute the strategy for the capabilities that power the DataDome customer lifecycle, from first-time setup and configuration through daily operation, expansion, and renewal. This role connects the customer-facing platform experience with the shared technical foundations and internal workflows required to make DataDome easier to adopt, operate, and scale. You will work across Product, Engineering, Design, Data, Security and Revenue Operations to create a coherent, secure, and increasingly automated platform experience for both customers and internal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact opportunity to shape the next generation of the DataDome platform. You will help customers adopt and expand their use of DataDome, while building the shared capabilities, AI-enabled experiences, and internal tools that make the platform easier to use, scale, and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the evolution of a seamless DataDome platform experience across the customer lifecycle, from onboarding and integration through operation and expansion.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will connect customer-facing experiences, shared technical foundations, and operational capabilities to make DataDome easier to adopt, administer, integrate, operate, and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer experience and adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and roadmap for DataDome’s shared platform and end-to-end customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the unified Dashboard and common components, creating an intuitive and consistent experience across products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the workspaces, onboarding, product-led growth, and cross-product workflows that accelerate adoption and time-to-value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unify how customers access insights, configure protection, and manage their organization across DataDome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to improve onboarding, self-service, customer insights, configuration, and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shared foundations for trust, integration, and scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
