&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn customer, business, and technical needs into a focused, outcome-driven roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make clear trade-offs across customer value, growth, platform leverage, reliability, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Product, Engineering, Design, Security, Finance, Revenue Operations, and Go-to-Market teams around priorities and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
